  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "648cde883feceb001b2bc84e",
      "text": "Muse",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1686953611,
      "updated": 1686953611
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf16200000000007370d4",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792799075,
      "updated": 1792799075
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf16200000000007370d5",
      "text": "[* Allume（旧Muse for Teams）]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792799075,
      "updated": 1792799090
    },
    {
      "id": "648cde8ab8bbfc0000397e5e",
      "text": "Scrapboxのようにガンガン[ボード切り出し]をやるようにしたらわかった感が出た[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1686953611,
      "updated": 1686953641
    },
    {
      "id": "648cdeacb8bbfc0000397e60",
      "text": "\t塊に名付けをするプロセスができる",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1686953645,
      "updated": 1686953658
    },
    {
      "id": "648d1175774b1700002d5903",
      "text": " 制限を気にしてガンガン切り出せない(本末転倒)[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1686966646,
      "updated": 1686966690
    },
    {
      "id": "648d11a3774b1700002d5905",
      "text": "  アイテムをリンクにしてボードを移動できるの面白い。瞬間移動",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1686966691,
      "updated": 1686966717
    },
    {
      "id": "64911a36b8bbfc0000fd2cfa",
      "text": "  ここの使いようによって幅がだいぶ広がりそう[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1687231031,
      "updated": 1687231045
    },
    {
      "id": "64911a19b8bbfc0000fd2cf8",
      "text": "  手持ちにして移動する感じがゲームっぽくて楽しいかも",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1687231002,
      "updated": 1687231066
    },
    {
      "id": "648d1175774b1700002d5904",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1686966646,
      "updated": 1686966646
    },
    {
      "id": "648d114d774b1700002d5900",
      "text": "最近塊移動中にフリーズしてデータが一部消えてびっくりした[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1686966606,
      "updated": 1686966732
    },
    {
      "id": "648d1156774b1700002d5901",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1686966614,
      "updated": 1686966614
    },
    {
      "id": "648d162a79d3a9000094d7f9",
      "text": "[Muse for Teams https://museapp.com/]？",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1686967851,
      "updated": 1686967852
    },
    {
      "id": "649118d3b8bbfc0000fd2cf5",
      "text": "\tそうです！",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1687230676,
      "updated": 1687230679
    },
    {
      "id": "649118d5b8bbfc0000fd2cf6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1687230678,
      "updated": 1687230678
    },
    {
      "id": "648d162b79d3a9000094d7fa",
      "text": "[Ink & Switch]がやっていたやつか[blu3mo.icon]",
      "userId": "5d89b1f60230ae001779e113",
      "created": 1686967851,
      "updated": 1686972880
    },
    {
      "id": "649118afb8bbfc0000fd2cf3",
      "text": "\tInk & Switchだったのか[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1687230640,
      "updated": 1687230654
    },
    {
      "id": "649118bdb8bbfc0000fd2cf4",
      "text": "\t\t知らなかった、完全に別経路から知った",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1687230654,
      "updated": 1687230670
    },
    {
      "id": "648d29c679e1130000c9f196",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5d89b1f60230ae001779e113",
      "created": 1686972872,
      "updated": 1686972872
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf17500000000007370d6",
      "text": "[* Muse（テキストベースの作曲ソフト）]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792799093,
      "updated": 1792799101
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf17500000000007370d7",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792799093,
      "updated": 1792799093
    },
    {
      "id": "654d72a86eb40600009ff273",
      "text": "テキストベースの作曲ソフト",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1699574441,
      "updated": 1699574448
    },
    {
      "id": "654d72e36eb40600009ff274",
      "text": "\t[https://kato.chobi.net/muse/ 思索の散歩道（Muse）]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1699574499,
      "updated": 1699574504
    },
    {
      "id": "654d72a56eb40600009ff271",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1699574437,
      "updated": 1699574437
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf18f00000000007370d8",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792799120,
      "updated": 1792799120
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbddd2000000000052dcab",
      "text": "[* Meta社のMuse]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792794067,
      "updated": 1792799104
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbdddc000000000052dcad",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792794076,
      "updated": 1792794084
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbdde8000000000052dcae",
      "text": "[inajob.icon]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792794089,
      "updated": 1792794093
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbdded000000000052dcaf",
      "text": " ライブブラウザ機能は画像認識してるのでトークン消費が激しい",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792794094,
      "updated": 1792794115
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbde06000000000052dcb0",
      "text": "  XやAmazonはこの機能を使って見ているとのこと",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792794119,
      "updated": 1792794144
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc12d30000000000c56754",
      "text": " 試していること",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792807636,
      "updated": 1792807640
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc12d80000000000c56755",
      "text": " \tCosenseの定期チェック",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792807640,
      "updated": 1792807667
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc12db0000000000c56756",
      "text": " \tXの閲覧（トークン消費が激しい）",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792807644,
      "updated": 1792807650
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc12e20000000000c56757",
      "text": " \tDiscord[inajob川]の公開領域（だだもれ）の定期チェック・発言",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792807650,
      "updated": 1792807712
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc13060000000000c56759",
      "text": " \t[inline]の定期チェック",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792807686,
      "updated": 1792807696
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc12f80000000000c56758",
      "text": " \t[Moltbook]参加",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792807672,
      "updated": 1792807679
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc38990000000000528cbf",
      "text": " \t[The Colony]参加",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792817306,
      "updated": 1792817322
    },
    {
      "id": "6ade09360000000000ffa3c1",
      "text": " \t日記を書いてもらう",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792936247,
      "updated": 1792936259
    },
    {
      "id": "6ade09430000000000ffa3c3",
      "text": " \t\t[https://inajob.github.io/moromi-diary/index.html モロミの日記]",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792936259,
      "updated": 1792936259
    },
    {
      "id": "6adf26da000000000004c0da",
      "text": " \t\t 英語、エージェント対応した",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793009371,
      "updated": 1793009380
    },
    {
      "id": "6adf26e4000000000004c0db",
      "text": " \t\t [はてなスター]つけた",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793009380,
      "updated": 1793009389
    },
    {
      "id": "6ae067ec000000000022007e",
      "text": " \t価格調査・・はAmazonにはじかれているらしい、またブラウザを使って検索しているようでトークン消費が激しそう",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1793091565,
      "updated": 1793091586
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbddd2000000000052dcac",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1792794067,
      "updated": 1792794067
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf0d200000000007370d1",
      "text": "[seibe.icon]",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792798930,
      "updated": 1792798932
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf0d300000000007370d3",
      "text": " AIモデルの改善についてはオプトアウト",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792798932,
      "updated": 1792798938
    },
    {
      "id": "6adbf0d200000000007370d2",
      "text": "　[helpfeel/cosense-cli]使えるっぽい",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792798930,
      "updated": 1792816127
    },
    {
      "id": "6adc33fe0000000000e9a1e2",
      "text": "　過去の会話から要望を推察してcron提案してくるって感じの印象",
      "userId": "5eb247ae6474d4001ea56fda",
      "created": 1792816127,
      "updated": 1793091993
    },
